      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FORMULA: CHI3 (Triiodomethane, m.p. 392 K / 119 \u00b0C)\nAppearance: Distinct yellow crystalline solid with persistent medicinal antiseptic smell.\nAntiseptic Action: Due to slow liberation of free elementary iodine (I2).\nIodoform Test: Positive for CH3-C=O (methyl ketones) and CH3-CH(OH)- (methyl carbinols).\nReagents: I2 + aq. NaOH / Na2CO3 (produces yellow CHI3 precipitate + RCOONa).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FORMULA: CHI3 (Triiodomethane, m.p. 392 K / 119 \u00b0C)\nAppearance: Distinct yellow crystalline solid with persistent medicinal antiseptic smell.\nAntiseptic Action: Due to slow liberation of free elementary iodine (I2).\nIodoform Test: Positive for CH3-C=O (methyl ketones) and CH3-CH(OH)- (methyl carbinols).\nReagents: I2 + aq. NaOH / Na2CO3 (produces yellow CHI3 precipitate + RCOONa).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
