      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FORMULA: CCl4 (Tetrachloromethane, b.p. 350 K)\nIndustrial Brand: 'Pyrene' (non-flammable industrial & laboratory fire extinguisher).\nSafety Hazards: Exposure causes severe liver cancer, kidney damage, cardiac arrest.\nEnvironmental Destruction: Releases chlorine radicals into stratosphere, depleting\nthe Earth's protective ozone layer, intensifying terrestrial UV-B radiation exposure.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "FORMULA: CCl4 (Tetrachloromethane, b.p. 350 K)\nIndustrial Brand: 'Pyrene' (non-flammable industrial & laboratory fire extinguisher).\nSafety Hazards: Exposure causes severe liver cancer, kidney damage, cardiac arrest.\nEnvironmental Destruction: Releases chlorine radicals into stratosphere, depleting\nthe Earth's protective ozone layer, intensifying terrestrial UV-B radiation exposure.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
