      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "POLYHALOGEN: FREON-12 & OZONE DEPLETION",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "POLYHALOGEN: FREON-12 & OZONE DEPLETION",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cb634815-db83-4f91-a897-42f9b1f21962",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5396,
      "y": 796,
      "width": 633.36,
      "height": 81.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 42,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CHLOROFLUOROCARBONS (CFCs): Freon-12 (CCl2F2)\nProduction: CCl4 + 2 SbF3 --(SbCl5 catalyst)--> CCl2F2 (Freon-12) + 2 SbCl3.\nProperties: Chemically inert, non-toxic, non-corrosive, liquefies easily under pressure.\nOzone Depletion Mechanism: CCl2F2 --(UV-C)--> .CF2Cl + Cl. (Chlorine radical).\nCatalytic Cycle: Cl. + O3 -> ClO. + O2;  ClO. + O -> Cl. + O2 (1 Cl. destroys 100,000 O3!).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CHLOROFLUOROCARBONS (CFCs): Freon-12 (CCl2F2)\nProduction: CCl4 + 2 SbF3 --(SbCl5 catalyst)--> CCl2F2 (Freon-12) + 2 SbCl3.\nProperties: Chemically inert, non-toxic, non-corrosive, liquefies easily under pressure.\nOzone Depletion Mechanism: CCl2F2 --(UV-C)--> .CF2Cl + Cl. (Chlorine radical).\nCatalytic Cycle: Cl. + O3 -> ClO. + O2;  ClO. + O -> Cl. + O2 (1 Cl. destroys 100,000 O3!).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
