      "text": "CARBONYL INTERMEDIATE HUB [R-CHO / R-CO-R']",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CARBONYL INTERMEDIATE HUB [R-CHO / R-CO-R']",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1b001433-d5ba-4d3b-9641-76a5c6ef56e3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4566,
      "y": 1466,
      "width": 661.2,
      "height": 81.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 42,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ALDEHYDES & KETONES [R-CHO / R-CO-R']\n\u2022 Oxidation from 1\u00b0 Alcohol: PCC (Pyridinium Chlorochromate) in CH2Cl2 or Cu at 573 K -> R-CHO.\n\u2022 Oxidation from 2\u00b0 Alcohol: Jones Reagent (CrO3 in H2SO4) or KMnO4 or Cu / 573 K -> R-CO-R'.\n\u2022 Carbonyl Reduction to Alcohol: NaBH4 (in MeOH) or LiAlH4 (in dry ether) or H2 / Raney Ni.\n\u2022 Haloform Reaction: R-CO-CH3 + 3 X2 + 4 NaOH -> R-COONa + CHX3 (Haloform) + 3 NaX + 3 H2O.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ALDEHYDES & KETONES [R-CHO / R-CO-R']\n\u2022 Oxidation from 1\u00b0 Alcohol: PCC (Pyridinium Chlorochromate) in CH2Cl2 or Cu at 573 K -> R-CHO.\n\u2022 Oxidation from 2\u00b0 Alcohol: Jones Reagent (CrO3 in H2SO4) or KMnO4 or Cu / 573 K -> R-CO-R'.\n\u2022 Carbonyl Reduction to Alcohol: NaBH4 (in MeOH) or LiAlH4 (in dry ether) or H2 / Raney Ni.\n\u2022 Haloform Reaction: R-CO-CH3 + 3 X2 + 4 NaOH -> R-COONa + CHX3 (Haloform) + 3 NaX + 3 H2O.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
