    {
      "id": "15819858-6c55-420e-8e1f-7f4a6200c4f3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5666,
      "y": 1466,
      "width": 668.16,
      "height": 81.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 42,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TERMINAL CARBOXYL SYSTEM [R-COOH]\n\u2022 Direct Synthesis: Complete oxidation of 1\u00b0 alcohol / aldehyde with acidic KMnO4 or K2Cr2O7.\n\u2022 Nitrile Hydrolysis: R-CN + 2 H2O + H+ --(heat)--> R-COOH + NH4+ (Connects Jump Badge [C1]).\n\u2022 Reduction to 1\u00b0 Alcohol: 1. LiAlH4 in dry ether, 2. H3O+ (or Diborane B2H6 in THF).\n\u2022 Hell-Volhard-Zelinsky (HVZ) Reaction: R-CH2-COOH + X2/Red P -> R-CH(X)-COOH (alpha-halo acid).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TERMINAL CARBOXYL SYSTEM [R-COOH]\n\u2022 Direct Synthesis: Complete oxidation of 1\u00b0 alcohol / aldehyde with acidic KMnO4 or K2Cr2O7.\n\u2022 Nitrile Hydrolysis: R-CN + 2 H2O + H+ --(heat)--> R-COOH + NH4+ (Connects Jump Badge [C1]).\n\u2022 Reduction to 1\u00b0 Alcohol: 1. LiAlH4 in dry ether, 2. H3O+ (or Diborane B2H6 in THF).\n\u2022 Hell-Volhard-Zelinsky (HVZ) Reaction: R-CH2-COOH + X2/Red P -> R-CH(X)-COOH (alpha-halo acid).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
