      "text": "AMINE CORRIDOR: HOFMANN AMMONOLYSIS",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AMINE CORRIDOR: HOFMANN AMMONOLYSIS",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "43e6a651-c554-4b79-8f31-fa521dd073e6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2476,
      "y": 1846,
      "width": 675.12,
      "height": 64.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 42,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PRIMARY AMINE [R-NH2] VIA AMMONOLYSIS\n\u2022 Reaction: R-X + excess ethanolic NH3 --(sealed tube, 373 K)--> R-NH2 + NH4X.\n\u2022 Mixture Limitation: R-X + NH3 -> 1\u00b0 amine -> 2\u00b0 amine -> 3\u00b0 amine -> [R4N]+ X-.\n\u2022 Excess NH3 favors 1\u00b0 amine as major product. Pure 1\u00b0 amine is obtained via Gabriel Phthalimide.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PRIMARY AMINE [R-NH2] VIA AMMONOLYSIS\n\u2022 Reaction: R-X + excess ethanolic NH3 --(sealed tube, 373 K)--> R-NH2 + NH4X.\n\u2022 Mixture Limitation: R-X + NH3 -> 1\u00b0 amine -> 2\u00b0 amine -> 3\u00b0 amine -> [R4N]+ X-.\n\u2022 Excess NH3 favors 1\u00b0 amine as major product. Pure 1\u00b0 amine is obtained via Gabriel Phthalimide.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
