      "text": "ACYL CHLORIDE [R-COCl]",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 14,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ACYL CHLORIDE [R-COCl]",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "647e52af-87c7-466d-a501-c74db8c952df",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4966,
      "y": 1846,
      "width": 605.52,
      "height": 64.8,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 42,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ACYL CHLORIDE [R-COCl]\n\u2022 Synthesis: R-COOH + SOCl2 (or PCl5 / PCl3) -> R-COCl + SO2(g) + HCl(g).\n\u2022 Highest reactivity among all acid derivatives towards nucleophilic acyl substitution.\n\u2022 Rapid Hydrolysis: R-COCl + H2O -> R-COOH + HCl (violent room temp reaction).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ACYL CHLORIDE [R-COCl]\n\u2022 Synthesis: R-COOH + SOCl2 (or PCl5 / PCl3) -> R-COCl + SO2(g) + HCl(g).\n\u2022 Highest reactivity among all acid derivatives towards nucleophilic acyl substitution.\n\u2022 Rapid Hydrolysis: R-COCl + H2O -> R-COOH + HCl (violent room temp reaction).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
