    {
      "id": "5e42c0fa-2a4b-431b-aeba-fb8535bec97d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1266,
      "y": 2226,
      "width": 598.56,
      "height": 81.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 42,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ALKANE NITRILE [R-CN / ALKYL CYANIDE]\n\u2022 Synthesis: R-X + KCN (alc. EtOH, heat) -> R-CN + KX (Nucleophilic attack by Carbon).\n\u2022 Versatile Synthetic Gateway: Increases carbon chain length by 1 carbon atom.\n\u2022 Stephen Reaction: R-CN + SnCl2 + HCl --(H3O+)--> Aldehyde (R-CHO).\n\u2022 Partial Hydrolysis: R-CN + conc. HCl / alk. H2O2 -> Amide (R-CONH2).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ALKANE NITRILE [R-CN / ALKYL CYANIDE]\n\u2022 Synthesis: R-X + KCN (alc. EtOH, heat) -> R-CN + KX (Nucleophilic attack by Carbon).\n\u2022 Versatile Synthetic Gateway: Increases carbon chain length by 1 carbon atom.\n\u2022 Stephen Reaction: R-CN + SnCl2 + HCl --(H3O+)--> Aldehyde (R-CHO).\n\u2022 Partial Hydrolysis: R-CN + conc. HCl / alk. H2O2 -> Amide (R-CONH2).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
