      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BENZENE DIAZONIUM CHLORIDE HUB [C6H5N2+ Cl-]\n\u2022 Sandmeyer Reaction: Cu2Cl2 / HCl -> Chlorobenzene;  Cu2Br2 / HBr -> Bromobenzene.\n\u2022 Gattermann Reaction: Cu powder + HCl -> Chlorobenzene; Cu powder + HBr -> Bromobenzene.\n\u2022 Iodobenzene Synthesis: Warm with aqueous KI -> C6H5I + N2 + KCl (No Cu catalyst needed).\n\u2022 Balz-Schiemann Reaction: + HBF4 -> C6H5N2+ BF4- --(heat)--> Fluorobenzene + BF3 + N2.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "BENZENE DIAZONIUM CHLORIDE HUB [C6H5N2+ Cl-]\n\u2022 Sandmeyer Reaction: Cu2Cl2 / HCl -> Chlorobenzene;  Cu2Br2 / HBr -> Bromobenzene.\n\u2022 Gattermann Reaction: Cu powder + HCl -> Chlorobenzene; Cu powder + HBr -> Bromobenzene.\n\u2022 Iodobenzene Synthesis: Warm with aqueous KI -> C6H5I + N2 + KCl (No Cu catalyst needed).\n\u2022 Balz-Schiemann Reaction: + HBF4 -> C6H5N2+ BF4- --(heat)--> Fluorobenzene + BF3 + N2.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
