      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BENZENE SUBSTRATE [C6H6]\n\u2022 Electrophilic Aromatic Substitution (EAS): C6H6 + Cl2 --(anh. FeCl3 / AlCl3 in dark)-->\n  Chlorobenzene (C6H5Cl) + HCl.\n\u2022 Electrophile: Chloronium ion (Cl+) generated by Lewis acid: Cl2 + FeCl3 -> Cl+ + [FeCl4]-.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
