    {
      "id": "2e50e497-975e-4d9e-9ce4-05649c714caf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3896,
      "y": 2726,
      "width": 654.24,
      "height": 113.4,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 42,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TOLUENE CORRIDOR: REGIOCHEMICAL CONTROL\n\u2022 Pathway A: Ring Electrophilic Substitution (EAS):\n  Toluene + Cl2 --(anh. FeCl3, dark, 298 K)--> o-Chlorotoluene + p-Chlorotoluene.\n\u2022 Pathway B: Side-Chain Free Radical Substitution:\n  Toluene + Cl2 --(h\u03bd / 383 K, boiling)--> Benzyl chloride (C6H5CH2Cl) ->\n  Benzal chloride (C6H5CHCl2) -> Benzotrichloride (C6H5CCl3).\n\u2022 Complete regiochemical divergence controlled exclusively by presence of light vs Lewis acid!",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TOLUENE CORRIDOR: REGIOCHEMICAL CONTROL\n\u2022 Pathway A: Ring Electrophilic Substitution (EAS):\n  Toluene + Cl2 --(anh. FeCl3, dark, 298 K)--> o-Chlorotoluene + p-Chlorotoluene.\n\u2022 Pathway B: Side-Chain Free Radical Substitution:\n  Toluene + Cl2 --(h\u03bd / 383 K, boiling)--> Benzyl chloride (C6H5CH2Cl) ->\n  Benzal chloride (C6H5CHCl2) -> Benzotrichloride (C6H5CCl3).\n\u2022 Complete regiochemical divergence controlled exclusively by presence of light vs Lewis acid!",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
