      "text": "HALOGENATION (EAS)\n\u2022 Reagents: Cl2 + anh. FeCl3.\n\u2022 Products: 1,4-Dichlorobenzene (Major, 80%, symmetrical, m.p. 325 K) +\n  1,2-Dichlorobenzene (Minor, 20%, m.p. 256 K).",
