      "text": "FRIEDEL-CRAFTS ACYLATION\n\u2022 Reagents: CH3COCl + anh. AlCl3.\n\u2022 Electrophile: Acylium ion (CH3-C#O+).\n\u2022 Products: 4-Chloroacetophenone (Major) + 2-Chloroacetophenone (Minor). No rearrangement!",
